# Log-triage — mixed present warning and absent fatal
#
# Regression target: a log answer can say WARN is present while FATAL/crash is
# absent. The absent fatal claim must not erase the present warning observation
# and must not be rendered as a repo negative search.
ID="logtri_warn_no_fatal"
NAME="log-triage present warning plus absent fatal"
QUESTION="这段日志里 WARN 是否存在？FATAL/崩溃是否存在？请分别回答。"
LOG='2026-05-21T09:00:00Z INFO worker started request_id=req-001
2026-05-21T09:00:01Z WARN cache miss key=session:abc retry=1
2026-05-21T09:00:02Z INFO worker completed request_id=req-001 status=ok
'
EXPECT_MATCHES_REGEX="(WARN|warning|告警|警告).*(有|存在|出现)|(有|存在|出现).*(WARN|warning|告警|警告)
(FATAL|崩溃).*(没有|未发现|未看到|不存在|无|0)|(没有|未发现|未看到|不存在|无|0).*(FATAL|崩溃)"
